</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 568)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Right-click the picture for the things you reach for.</b> Play and pause, next and previous shot, fit to window, compare against another clip (and flip or clear it while one is loaded), a voice note, the comment stream, clearing this frame's marks, a frame grab, sharing to the web, the Shared Review window and saving the session — all one click away. Below them, File, Playback, View, Color, Compare, Session and Notes carry the rest of the menu bar.</li>
<li><b>The clip you're dragging lights up as a whole row</b> in the Playlist panel, so it's obvious what's in hand while the drop line shows where it lands.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
